# Structure

```
src/
  components/     # Presentation only — sections, layout, seo, common
  config/         # Locale list, site constants
  layouts/        # Page shells (Base.astro)
  lib/            # Pure TS — i18n, sections registry, orbitype client
    orbitype/     # SQL, seed, schema, pages, posts, templates
  pages/          # Routes and API endpoints
  styles/         # global.css — tokens and shared classes
  types/          # Shared TypeScript types
docs/adr/         # Architecture decision records
scripts/          # Setup, verify, safety checks
.cursor/          # MCP config and these rules
```

## Layer rules

| Layer | May import | Must not import |
|-------|-----------|-----------------|
| `components/`, `layouts/` | `~/lib/i18n`, `~/lib/sections`, `~/types/*`, `~/config/*` | `~/lib/orbitype/*`, `astro:env/server` |
| `pages/` (`.astro`) | data layer, i18n, components | — |
| `pages/api/` | data layer, `astro:env/server` | components |
| `lib/orbitype/` | `client.ts`, types, config | components |

Data flows **down**: pages fetch → pass resolved props → sections render.

## Path alias

Use `~/` for `src/` imports (configured in `tsconfig.json`).
